# Tor Hardened Middle Relay Configuration

Production-grade **`torrc`** configuration file optimized for Arch Linux. Features strict DNS leak protection, native IPv6 support, bandwidth traffic control, and CGNAT bypass using the `AssumeReachable` directive [~ ➜, ~ ➜].

## Configuration File (`torrc`)

```ini
DataDirectory /var/lib/tor
SocksPort 127.0.0.1:9050

# Prevenção de Vazamento de DNS
DNSPort 127.0.0.1:53530
AutomapHostsOnResolve 1
AutomapHostsSuffixes .onion,.exit
TestSocks 1

# Modo Middle Relay + CGNAT Bypass
ORPort 9001
DirPort 0
AssumeReachable 1

# Suporte Nativo IPv6
ORPort [::]:9001 IPv6Only

# Identidade do Nó
Nickname GithubDotfiled
ContactInfo youremail@idkmail.com

# Trava Anti-Exit (Zero Risco)
ExitRelay 0
ExitPolicy reject *:*

# Controle de Banda Média
BandwidthRate 4 MBytes
BandwidthBurst 8 MBytes
AccountingMax 600 GBytes
AccountingStart month 1 00:00

# Proteção de Memória e Circuitos
MaxCircuitDirtiness 120
CircuitPadding 1
ReducedConnectionPadding 0
SafeLogging 1
Log notice file /var/log/tor/notices.log
```

## Deployment

1. Copy the configuration block to `/etc/tor/torrc` [~ ➜].
2. Verify the configuration integrity: `tor --verify-config` [~ ➜].
3. Restart the background service daemon: `sudo systemctl restart tor` [~ ➜].
